	+ k / 26 = 1, remainder = 3 (ASCII code = 99), append "c" to the string.
	+ k / 26 = 0, remainder = 27 (ASCII code = 98), append "b" to the string.
	+ k / 26 = -1, no quotient is left, the loop stops.
	+ Return the reversed string "bac".

